ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiaohua wants to persuade his parents to allow him to go out at night to attend a friend's birthday party. His parents worry about the safety of going out at night and hope that he focuses on the upcoming academic exams.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Xiaohua persuade his parents?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. He suggests that parents or other adult relatives attend the party to increase the confidence of the parents.\nB. He can promise to send messages to his parents regularly, informing them of his situation.\nC. He proposes this as a trial and guarantees that it does not affect the grades.\nD. He can propose to hold a small party at home or participate in other safe social activities as an alternative.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266817116002895,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e168d6006945d27ff40a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367848508,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:30:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6d7e6eea582a49a8a5823f5c143fc428"}